airments requiring the use of a wheelchair <br> • Diabetes <br> • Schizophrenia <br> • Missing limbs or partially missing limbs <br> • Intellectual disability (previously called mental retardation) <br> • Epilepsy <br> • Muscular dystrophy"}, {"choices": [{"value": "EEOCDisability_Y", "label": "Yes, I have a disability (or previously had a disability)"}, {"value": "EEOCDisability_N", "label": "No, I don't have a disability"}, {"value": "EEOCDisability_NA", "label": "Decline to answer"}], "type": "dropdown", "label": "Disability", "question Id": "[Applicant.EEOCDisability]", "choices Sort Order": "ascending", "required": false}, {"type": "instruction", "label": "I understand that in connection with the application process, Infineon Technologies Americas Corp. (the “ Company”) may check the official publication of restricted parties in the Federal Register and/or the official lists of restricted parties maintained on the websites of the Departments of Commerce, State, and Treasury to ensure full compliance with all of the terms and conditions of the restrictions placed on the parties on these lists.<br><br> I also understand that in connection with the application process, the Company may check the INTERPOL Criminal Information System of Notices that contains personal information and criminal history, including international alerts for fugitives, suspected criminals, persons linked to or of interest in an ongoing criminal investigation, persons and entities subject to UN Security Council Sanctions, potential threats, missing persons, and deceased persons.<br><br> I understand that the information contained in the restricted parties lists maintained by the United States government and the INTERPOL Criminal Information System may be used in whole or in part for the purpose of evaluating me for employment.<br><br> I hereby authorize the Company to check the restricted parties lists maintained by the United States government and the INTERPOL Criminal Information System as